    "description": "### Impact\r\nUpload records restored from a crafted backup can make the animated GIF detection job read arbitrary URLs without the usual SSRF protections. Only sites with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\r\n",
